@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2C3E50
    LifeLineBorderColor #2C3E50
    ParticipantBorderColor #2C3E50
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #ECF0F1
}

title Seguridad en WebSockets: Autenticación JWT, Rate Limiting y Control de Acceso

actor "Cliente (Frontend)" as Client
participant "Servidor SockJS / Tomcat" as Transport
participant "WebSocketSecurityInterceptor" as Interceptor
participant "JwtUtils" as JWTService
participant "PlayerService" as PlayerService
participant "SimpleBroker (STOMP)" as Broker

== 1. Negociación de Transporte y Handshake ==

Client -> Transport: GET /ws-upstream/info
Transport --> Client: 200 OK { websocket: true, origins: [...] }

Client -> Transport: GET /ws-upstream/{server}/{session}/websocket\n[Cabeceras: Upgrade: websocket, Connection: Upgrade]
Transport --> Client: 101 Switching Protocols

== 2. Autenticación de Sesión STOMP (CONNECT) ==

Client -> Interceptor: STOMP Frame: CONNECT\n[Cabecera: Authorization: Bearer <jwt>]
activate Interceptor

Interceptor -> JWTService: validateJwtToken(jwt)
JWTService --> Interceptor: true [Token válido y firmado]

Interceptor -> JWTService: getUserNameFromJwtToken(jwt)
JWTService --> Interceptor: username

Interceptor -> Interceptor: Asociar usuario autenticado a la sesión STOMP
Interceptor --> Broker: Permite conexión de sesión
deactivate Interceptor

Broker --> Client: STOMP Frame: CONNECTED

== 3. Control de Suscripción y Límite de Frecuencia (SUBSCRIBE) ==

Client -> Interceptor: STOMP Frame: SUBSCRIBE /topic/tilesAndSalmons/{matchId}
activate Interceptor

Interceptor -> Interceptor: checkRateLimit(username) [Máximo 60 mensajes / minuto]
Interceptor -> Interceptor: validatePayload(frame) [Límite de 64 KB]

Interceptor -> Interceptor: validateRouteAndExtractMatchId(destination)
note right
  Verifica coincidencia contra rutas
  permitidas y extrae el identificador.
end note

Interceptor -> PlayerService: isUserInMatch(username, matchId)
PlayerService --> Interceptor: true [Usuario es participante de la partida]

Interceptor -> Interceptor: Registrar participante en caché (userMatchCache)
Interceptor --> Broker: Autoriza suscripción al canal
deactivate Interceptor

Broker --> Client: Suscripción confirmada

note over Client, Broker
  ref Diagrama 10 del Toolkit (10_Secuencia_Seguridad_WebSocket_Interceptor)
  Defensas DoS a nivel de transporte (Rate Limiting y límite de 64 KB de payload).
end note

@enduml
